{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19777","headline":"贫女词寄从叔先辈简 · 孟郊","name":"贫女词寄从叔先辈简","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蚕女非不勤，今年独无春。\n二月冰雪深，死尽万木身。\n时令自逆行，造化岂不仁。\n仰企碧霞仙，高控沧海云。\n永别劳苦场，飘颻游无垠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}